# Public GitHub texts — English only

Applies to **every public GitHub repo** Alessandro publishes (not only this project).

README, CREDITS, LICENSE body, repo description, topics, release notes,
and public-facing PR text: **English only**. No Italian/English mix.

- Chat with Alessandro stays Italian.
- In-app UI may stay Italian when that is the product language.
- In public docs, English first; Italian UI labels in parentheses once
  (e.g. Print (`Stampa`)).
